{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "על עלתך", :translit "al olatkha", :gloss "on your burnt offering"} {:he "טוב פת חרבה ושלוה בה מבית מלא זבחי ריב", :translit "tov pat charavah v'shalvah bah m'beit malei zivchei riv", :gloss "better a dry morsel and quietness therein than a house full of sacrifices of strife"} {:he "ר\"ת ממזר", :translit "rashei teivot mamzer", :gloss "initial letters form mamzer"} {:he "משבעה פרים ושבעה אילים", :translit "mi-shiv'ah parim v'shiv'ah eilim", :gloss "from seven bulls and seven rams"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :rashei-tevot, :phrase "מבית מלא זבחי ריב", :spells "ממזר"} {:kind :other, :note "על עלתך written deficient (missing vav) to signal God's rejection of Moab's offerings"}], :frame {:text "Moab's offerings are rejected because of their origins. Genesis 19:36–37 records that Moab was born from Lot's incestuous relation with his daughter, and Deuteronomy 23:4 excludes Ammonite and Moabite from the congregation. Proverbs 17:1 articulates the principle that God rejects sacrifices born of discord.", :sources ["Genesis 19:36–37" "Deuteronomy 23:4" "Proverbs 17:1"]}} {:quotes [{:he "יִרְאַנִי", :translit "yir'ani", :gloss "He will show me"} {:he "אֱלֹהִים יִרְאַנִי בְשׁוֹרֵרִי", :translit "Elohim yir'ani b'shor'ri", :gloss "God show me my adversary"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 2, :occurrences ["יִרְאַנִי" "אֱלֹהִים יִרְאַנִי בְשׁוֹרֵרִי"]}], :frame {:text "The word יראני appears in only two places: here in Numbers 23:3 and in Psalms 92:10 (אֱלֹהִים יִרְאַנִי בְשׁוֹרֵרִי). The Masorah note links the two to reveal Balaam's inner disposition: in Psalms 92:10 the speaker asks God to show him his adversary so he can triumph over him; so too here Balaam seeks to view Israel in order to curse them.", :sources ["Numbers 23:3" "Psalms 92:10"]}} {:quotes [{:he "וַיֵּלֶךְ שָׁפִי", :translit "vayeilekh shafi", :gloss "and he went barefoot"} {:he "חִגֵּר בַּרֶגֶל", :translit "chiger baregel", :gloss "lame in the leg"} {:he "שׁוּף מִדּוּכְתֵּיהּ", :translit "shuf miduch'teih", :gloss "crushed his mill-press / grinding-stone"} {:he "ותלחץ רגל בלעם אל הקיר", :translit "v'tilchatzt regel bil'am el hakir", :gloss "and pressed Balaam's foot against the wall"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :gematria, :a "וילך שפי", :b "חגר ברגל"} {:kind :other, :note "Alternative reading of שפי from root שוף (crush) because Balaam's foot was crushed against the wall (Numbers 22:25)"}], :frame {:text "Numbers 22:25 recounts that the angel's donkey pressed Balaam's foot against the wall. Ba'al HaTurim links that physical injury to Balaam's condition when he later goes to seek prophecies: the verse's gematria and its alternate root-reading both indicate he was left limping from that wound.", :sources ["Numbers 22:25" "Numbers 23:3"]}} {:quotes [{:he "שָׁפִי", :translit "shafi", :gloss "barefoot"} {:he "שפשפש וחפש", :translit "shifshaf v'chafash", :gloss "scrutinized and searched"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :other, :note "Pe alef in שפי is doubled (כפולה), read as intensive root indicating repeated searching"}], :frame nil}], :arithmetic [{:kind :rashei-tevot, :phrase "מבית מלא זבחי ריב", :spells "ממזר", :letters ["מ" "מ" "ז" "ר"], :by :selah, :order :in-order} {:kind :other, :note "על עלתך written deficient (missing vav) to signal God's rejection of Moab's offerings", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :masorah, :count 2, :occurrences ["יִרְאַנִי" "אֱלֹהִים יִרְאַנִי בְשׁוֹרֵרִי"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "יִרְאַנִי", :refs [], :n 0, :lens :plene-insensitive} {:phrase "אֱלֹהִים יִרְאַנִי בְשׁוֹרֵרִי", :refs [], :n 0, :lens :plene-insensitive}]} {:kind :gematria, :a "וילך שפי", :a-value 456, :b "חגר ברגל", :b-value 446, :lens :standard, :by :selah, :equal? false} {:kind :other, :note "Alternative reading of שפי from root שוף (crush) because Balaam's foot was crushed against the wall (Numbers 22:25)", :by :selah, :ran? false} {:kind :other, :note "Pe alef in שפי is doubled (כפולה), read as intensive root indicating repeated searching", :by :selah, :ran? false}], :book :numbers, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:31:05.931655241Z", :model "glm-5.2"}